# audio_diag_mode.txt - Diagnostic mode for picoarch audio idle noise
# Place this file as /mnt/sdcard/cubegm/audio_diag_mode.txt on the SD card
# Accepted exact modes: NORMAL, NO_INIT, INIT_DEINIT, ZERO_PCM, LSB8_ALT, LSB8_PRNG
# If file does not exist, is empty, or contains unknown value, MODE=NORMAL
# NORMAL preserves production behavior
NORMAL
